+/* Components: docs/product/design.md §7, platform rules §3, refinement §11. Spacing comes only from the --space-*
+   tokens; sizes are multiples of 4 px, so every box edge lands on the grid. */
+
+/* Icons: SVG files used as masks, so colour comes from the element. */
