+
+/* Islands (design §11.7): every section and card is a raised surface straight on the page, with no plate, group
+   background or tinted box behind it. Colour by background-color, so emphasis washes layer over it as images. Pressed
+   or hovered, an island darkens in place instead of turning see-through. */
+.island {
